note contract 5 abstract line 136: a bare number where dup32 is required is error 7 (xor is listed).
om2
abstract dup32 ulong ops rotr xor
holds dup32 dup32
fn dup32mk x uint to dup32
ret seal dup32 or shl ulong x 32 ulong x
end
fn main to int
d = dup32mk 5
e = xor d 5
puth open e
